      "annotation": {
        "description": "THE ONE METRIC of the throughput track (livespec-dev-tooling-q26e3c). COUNT of merged pull requests whose covering default-branch CI run concluded success, per hour, by repo. One event per merged PR, timestamped at the merge. Green = the first CI push run at or after the PR's merge head that reached a verdict succeeded (a concurrency-cancelled run is not a verdict). Emitter: the merged-green reconciler (livespec-dev-tooling-gaetnq; a stopgap emits until it lands). Definition: plan/throughput-track-organization/research/003.",
        "id": "AgM9Zsh782f",
        "name": "THROUGHPUT \u2014 PRs merged green per hour, by repository",
        "query_id": "F3pXRsE3KVR",
        "source": "query"
      },
      "dataset": "pr-throughput",
      "position": {
        "height": 9,
        "width": 8,
        "x_coordinate": 0,
        "y_coordinate": 0
      },
      "query": {
        "breakdowns": [
          "repo"
